<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-gender-regime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Gender-based constraints vary significantly across lineages and are often the subject of active debate. Record the constraint as asserted; use iroko:contestedStatus and iroko:assertionStatus to represent disputed cases."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-ritual-condition> .
