<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates an EpistemicConstraint with a ConstraintBasis concept classifying its foundation."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A SKOS concept describing the basis for an epistemic constraint: initiation, lineage, community mandate, ritual condition, safety, or unknown."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintSanctionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SanctionedDisclosure> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DisclosurePermission> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintSanctionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RitualAuthority> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-temporal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Temporal"@en .
