<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-ritual-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constraint basis asserted as a ritual state or condition — mourning period, ritual preparation, post-initiation obligation, etc."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EpistemicConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-safety> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-gender-regime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender Regime"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EpistemicConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A constraint describing conditions under which knowledge may be disclosed, withheld, transformed, or restricted. The abstract superclass — use DisclosurePermission, DisclosureRestriction, or SanctionedDisclosure for typed instances. iroko:hasTemporalVariation (Core) may be applied to qualify constraints that vary by season, cycle, or ritual state."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EpistemicConstraint> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic/1.3.0> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-initiation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-temporal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasEpistemicConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Iroko Framework: Epistemic Module"@en .
