<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constraint note"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-gender-regime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constraint basis asserted as a tradition-specific gender regime governing access. These are culturally defined and may be contested — model with iroko:contestedStatus where appropriate."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-ritual-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ritual Condition"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DisclosureRestriction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-gender-regime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintSanctionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasEpistemicConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EpistemicConstraint> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-gender-regime> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/requires> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-core> .
