<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintSanctionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constraint sanctioned by"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DisclosurePermission> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An epistemic constraint asserting that disclosure is permitted under specified conditions. The conditions may be temporal, initiatory, lineage-bound, or community-mandated."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-temporal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has constraint basis"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Free-text description of the epistemic constraint — what it restricts or permits and why."@en .
