<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintSanctionedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-lineage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constraint basis asserted as lineage affiliation. Knowledge belongs to a specific transmission line."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DisclosurePermission> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disclosure Permission"@en .
