<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-community-mandate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Community Mandate"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-epistemic> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-framework/> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-initiation> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DisclosureRestriction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disclosure Restriction"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-temporal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constraint basis asserted as time-bound — a festival period, mourning cycle, ritual season, or other temporal regime. Use with iroko:hasTemporalVariation for structured modeling."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Unknown"@en .
