<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-initiation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Initiation"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#constraintNote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#basis-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constraint basis not known or not recorded."@en .
