<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ConstraintBasisScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Controlled terms describing the foundation for epistemic constraints on sacred knowledge."@en .
